#. i18n: C:/Users/mf/Documents/XTrackCAD/src/work/app/lib/demos/dmcircle.xtr:7
#: ../../../../build/work/app/i18n/custmsg.h:256
msgid ""
"Like the <Curve> track command, there are several ways to create a Circle "
