#. i18n: C:/Users/mf/Documents/XTrackCAD/src/work/app/lib/demos/dmcrvtrk.xtr:7
#: ../../../../build/work/app/i18n/custmsg.h:295
msgid "There are several ways to create a Curved track.\n"
